    narr:generatedFrom "19778572fc4d056e81d3157c4a182534e8aa3de7" ;
    narr:narration """This hub concerns the thesis that [decision capture at the point of consensus](narr:https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Position_CoreFeatureDecisionCapture) is the product's primary differentiator — capturing the decision artifact at the moment it's made, not retrospectively (Mar 2026). Two Jul 2026 expressions from TanyaTeamowner report delivery against that thesis: [async decision widget shipped](narr:https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1E2ETanyaCollab1784369509414_1) and [Zephyr integration as the key unlock](narr:https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1E2ETanyaCollab1784369509414_3), framing the integration as the enabling mechanism rather than the widget itself. A fourth child frames [Sprint 4 delivery and what enabled it](narr:https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Position_SprintDeliveryUnlock) as an open question but carries no content yet, leaving the sprint-level account unelaborated. The hub spans: the core differentiator claim (Mar 2026), the delivery event and its technical enabler (Jul 2026), and an empty sprint framing awaiting elaboration. Queries about what was shipped, what enabled it, or the consensus-capture differentiator belong here; queries about market positioning, user adoption, or post-ship outcomes do not.""" ;
    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1E2ETanyaCollab1784369509414_1> ;
    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1E2ETanyaCollab1784369509414_3> ;
    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Position_CoreFeatureDecisionCapture> ;
    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Position_SprintDeliveryUnlock> ;
    narr:keyPhrase [ narr:text "We shipped the async decision widget." ; narr:phraseSource <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1E2ETanyaCollab1784369509414_1> ] ;
    narr:keyPhrase [ narr:text "The Zephyr integration was the key unlock." ; narr:phraseSource <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1E2ETanyaCollab1784369509414_3> ] ;
    narr:keyPhrase [ narr:text "Core feature: decision capture at the point of consensus. This is the product's primary differentiator — capturing the decision artifact at the moment it's made." ; narr:phraseSource <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Position_CoreFeatureDecisionCapture> ] ;
    narr:variation [ narr:text "The widget and the integration are framed as co-deliverables, but the causal weight differs: one child names the widget as the shipped artifact, the other names the Zephyr integration as the enabling unlock — leaving open whether the integration is a dependency, a feature, or the real differentiator." ; narr:over <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1E2ETanyaCollab1784369509414_1> ; narr:over <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1E2ETanyaCollab1784369509414_3> ] ;
    narr:variation [ narr:text "The Sprint 4 framing exists as a named question with no content — the sprint-level account of what was delivered and why is structurally present but empty, so any answer to that question is not yet here." ; narr:over <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Position_SprintDeliveryUnlock> ] ;
